% BibTeX has no comment syntax: these assertion lines are `junk` to the
% grammar, which is why they scope as comments and why they can only sit
% between entries. A `%` line inside an entry makes that entry unparseable,
% so every entry here is written on one line and asserted underneath it.

@string{acm = "Association for Computing Machinery"}
